{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winner of the Best Gameplay award at 2DCon 2025!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/ff42c3e4cbf8ef435461060552d5f2c2.avif?t=1756336933\" width=500 height=487 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A platformer/shooter inspired by the PS2 Ratchet and Clank games! A true love letter to the PS2 era!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/60252acf4fc8ade03ad61a32cdb59443.poster.avif?t=1756336933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/60252acf4fc8ade03ad61a32cdb59443.webm?t=1756336933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/60252acf4fc8ade03ad61a32cdb59443.mp4?t=1756336933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE SPACE AND DISCOVER NEW WORLDS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/b4978f40ae1dfc412c5f57b3585c4655.poster.avif?t=1756336933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/b4978f40ae1dfc412c5f57b3585c4655.webm?t=1756336933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/b4978f40ae1dfc412c5f57b3585c4655.mp4?t=1756336933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the galaxy exploring all sorts of new worlds all controlled by the galXE Corporation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lush jungles and white sand beaches of Relaxium (just watch out for the local population kidnapping tourists and forcing them to fight in a combat arena)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/5f9c68097d5f0c273d7e4dc02f31b9c9.poster.avif?t=1756336933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/5f9c68097d5f0c273d7e4dc02f31b9c9.webm?t=1756336933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or the busy city skyline of Earth+ where striking robot union members make business hard to do</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/7d91b3e2a00c0cbba04c0fa1f39dfd7f.poster.avif?t=1756336933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438470/extras/7d91b3e2a00c0cbba04c0fa1f39dfd7f.webm?t=1756336933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRY OUT FUTURISTIC NEW WEAPONS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out many of galXE's new weapons, including: The Fister 5000! Great for any situation... like if you want to punch someone in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta